    <item>
      <title>Making sense of loss and damage at the national level</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41558-026-02768-w</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Climate Change, Published online: 07 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41558-026-02768-w"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41558-026-02768-w&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Climate change is already causing widespread losses and damages, and these impacts will intensify as human and natural systems exceed their capacity to adapt. Recent research allows us to understand if and how countries are prioritizing this issue in national policies.</content:encoded>
